<mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;font color='#666666'&gt;Every arrow between repos is a mocap-contracts message or a file in the session folder layout. 3.2 runs 2D per camera as each video arrives when FreeMoCap allows it (mocap-extract body/1 pre-work).&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="965" width="1490" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
